# Arena symbol interner: all growth/probes/hashes/byte comparisons are A0.
# Entries are5 fullu32 fields: sourceHandle,start,length,hash,id. IDs start at0.
# Source handles/bytes must stay immutable and live for the invocation; FINISH frees all.
# Header is(vector,hashTableHandle,powerOfTwoSlots,used). Old headers are mutable views.
use "arena_vector.a0"
use "symbol_arena_shared.a0"
